{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Chronicles: Wasteland Assault - Supporter Pack 2</strong>, offers users 6 new, exclusive skins for the following weapons:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BMG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SMG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shotgun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sniper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Rifle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The skin, known as &quot;Vintage&quot;, will show everyone in the Victorian Wasteland that you are an individual who appreciates a clean, and stylish look for their weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This pack also allows the user to unlock an exclusive blue laser color for the corresponding attachment, complimenting both the new look and style of the weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These new customization options can be accessed in the weapons inspection tab, in the Main menu.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417420?t=1746671585","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417420?t=1746671585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417420/dfb019a60999df6ba1e15e4eb78c2a33ce9b6b0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746671585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417420/dfb019a60999df6ba1e15e4eb78c2a33ce9b6b0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746671585","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Constant Killing and Gore "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Chronicles: Wasteland Assault - Supporter Pa